      ["Which form of be goes with میں (I)?",["ہے","ہوں","ہیں","ہو"],1,"میں takes ہوں: میں ٹھیک ہوں."],
      ["How do you say He is a doctor and She is a doctor?",["The same: وہ ڈاکٹر ہے","وہ for he, یہ for she","Only by adding a name","With ہوں for she"],0,"وہ and یہ do not show he or she."],
      ["Where does ہے go in a sentence?",["Right after the subject, as in English","At the start","At the end","Anywhere"],2,"The verb goes at the end in Urdu: یہ کتاب ہے."]
